# qmldir — explicit module manifest for quickshell/modules/bar/ (Phase 18
# Plan 05, QBAR-02)
#
# Checking this file in disables Quickshell's directory-scanner synthesis for
# this directory (same finding as modules/qmldir and modules/dashboard/qmldir
# above it) — any .qml type added to this directory that is NOT declared
# below becomes unresolvable to Bar.qml's `import "bar"`, with NO load error.
# A type MUST be registered in the SAME commit that creates it.
#
# This manifest is owned by plan 18-05 and frozen for wave 3 (18-08, 18-09,
# 18-10, 18-11): a wave-3 plan that finds it needs an unlisted type here has
# found an 18-05 scope correction, not a licence to edit this file — the
# exact 14-03 precedent modules/dashboard/qmldir's own header records.
#
# `BarEntryModel` is the one entry list and carries the `singleton` keyword
# (12-06's both-required finding: pragma Singleton in source AND this
# keyword here, or the type is never constructed and reads undefined
# forever with no load error). The seven capsule types below it —
# `BarCapsule` (the shared chrome) plus the six pre-declared slots — are
# each an ordinary instance, not a singleton, so their lifetime stays
# explicit rather than ambient; `Bar.qml` instantiates each exactly once.
#
# `BrightnessBackend` (Phase 18 Plan 12, QBAR-04, D-18-39) added in wave 4.
# This manifest's freeze (below) was scoped to WAVE 3 (18-08/09/10/11) by
# its own text — 18-05's own success criteria already name later plans'
# types (SectionPopout for 18-13, HotZone for 18-16) as in-bounds additions
# to this same manifest, so this registration is in bounds, not a
# violation. Same both-required singleton form as BarEntryModel above.
module qs.modules.bar
singleton BarEntryModel 1.0 BarEntryModel.qml
singleton BrightnessBackend 1.0 BrightnessBackend.qml
BarCapsule 1.0 BarCapsule.qml
LauncherCapsule 1.0 LauncherCapsule.qml
SystemCapsule 1.0 SystemCapsule.qml
WorkspaceCapsule 1.0 WorkspaceCapsule.qml
MediaConnectivityCapsule 1.0 MediaConnectivityCapsule.qml
ClockActionsCapsule 1.0 ClockActionsCapsule.qml
# IdleInhibitorCapsule (GATE-02 operator fix, item (b)) added after the
# wave-3 freeze above had already served its purpose — the bulb's own
# centre-zone capsule, holding the backend/cell relocated out of
# ClockActionsCapsule.qml. See that file's own header note (a).
IdleInhibitorCapsule 1.0 IdleInhibitorCapsule.qml
# TrayCapsule 1.0 TrayCapsule.qml — REMOVED by phase 18.1 plan 04 (D-15):
# the tray capsule was deleted along with its qmldir row, its two Bar.qml
# consumers (componentFor() branch + trayComponent Component block) and its
# BarEntryModel entry, matching Athena's own config, whose tray was dropped
# because nm-applet/blueman icons duplicated the connections group. Do not
# re-add this row without first re-adding TrayCapsule.qml itself.

# SectionPopout / PopoutController / PopoutTrigger / AudioPopout (Phase 18
# Plan 13, QBAR-09) added in WAVE 5, after the wave-3 freeze above had
# already served its purpose. PopoutController carries the singleton
# keyword — this manifest's SECOND singleton after BarEntryModel — and
# needs pragma Singleton in its own source file as well as the keyword
# here (the 12-06 both-required finding, same shape as
# BarEntryModel/BrightnessBackend above). SectionPopout, PopoutTrigger and
# AudioPopout are ordinary instance types, each instantiated explicitly by
# name rather than held as an ambient singleton.
SectionPopout 1.0 SectionPopout.qml
singleton PopoutController 1.0 PopoutController.qml
PopoutTrigger 1.0 PopoutTrigger.qml
AudioPopout 1.0 AudioPopout.qml

# 18-14 appends the other five D-18-16 bodies across three commits, one per
# task/body-group, per this manifest's own rule that a type is registered
# in the commit that creates it: WifiPopout/BluetoothPopout (Task 1),
# ClockPopout/ResourcesPopout (Task 2), MediaPopout (Task 3). None is a
# singleton — each is instantiated once per popout summon through its own
# PopoutTrigger's popoutComponent, never held ambiently.
WifiPopout 1.0 WifiPopout.qml
BluetoothPopout 1.0 BluetoothPopout.qml
ClockPopout 1.0 ClockPopout.qml
ResourcesPopout 1.0 ResourcesPopout.qml
MediaPopout 1.0 MediaPopout.qml

# BarReveal / HotZone (Phase 18 Plan 16, QBAR-08) — the reveal state machine
# and the invisible input-only hot zone. BarReveal carries the singleton
# keyword (the 12-06 both-required finding, same shape as BarEntryModel/
# PopoutController above — needs pragma Singleton in its own source file as
# well as this keyword). HotZone is an ordinary instance type, mounted once
# by shell.qml behind a loader keyed on the hidden state.
singleton BarReveal 1.0 BarReveal.qml
HotZone 1.0 HotZone.qml

# BarRoles (Phase 18.1 Plan 01, D-03) — the bar-scoped colour role layer
# every capsule's colour expression routes through, replacing direct
# Colours.* references under modules/bar/. Carries the singleton keyword
# (the 12-06 both-required finding, same shape as every other singleton
# above — needs pragma Singleton in its own source file as well as this
# keyword here, or the type resolves undefined forever with no load
# error).
singleton BarRoles 1.0 BarRoles.qml

# BarDrawer (18-11's Option B for D-18-11's vertical drawers, taken as an
# 18-05 scope correction by quick task 260812-59l, closing GATE-02 row
# B.4-DRAWER) — the shared LazyLoader-gated anchored strip surface that
# hosts the launcher and settings drawers in vertical orientation. An
# ORDINARY instance type, NOT a singleton: LauncherCapsule.qml and
# ClockActionsCapsule.qml each mount their own instance behind their own
# LazyLoader, keyed on `vertical && expanded`.
BarDrawer 1.0 BarDrawer.qml

# BarTooltip / BarTooltipHost (quick task 260812-69w, F2 — GATE-02
# iteration-1 defect) — the escaping layer-shell tooltip surface and its
# per-site dwell-timer/LazyLoader host. Both ORDINARY instance types, NOT
# singletons: each of the four BAR-WINDOW tooltip sites
# (IdleInhibitorCapsule.qml, ClockActionsCapsule.qml's ActionCell,
# MediaConnectivityCapsule.qml, LauncherCapsule.qml) mounts its own
# BarTooltipHost, which in turn LazyLoader-mounts its own BarTooltip
# instance on dwell.
BarTooltip 1.0 BarTooltip.qml
BarTooltipHost 1.0 BarTooltipHost.qml
